  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dbd6ee4ba19a0c644b9d86ffb56f4050, type: 3}
  m_Name: D_MomCall
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - "Sao th\u1EBF b\xE0 gi\xE0;"
  - "Mom:\nH\xED - L\xE2u r\u1ED3i ko \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c n\xF3i chuy\u1EC7n v\u1EDBi
    con, d\u1EA1o n\xE0y con th\u1EBF n\xE0o v\u1EADy?"
  - "T\xF4i s\u1ED1ng \u1ED5n b\xE0 gi\xE0 ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 t\xF4i, ngo\xE0i b\u1ECB
    m\u1EE1 m\xE1u, x\u01A1 gan, ti\u1EC3u \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng, v\xE0 1 t\u1EF7
    c\xE1i b\u1EC7nh n\u1EC1n kh\xE1c li\xEAn quan \u0111\u1EBFn c\xE2n n\u1EB7ng
    ra th\xEC t\xF4i \u1ED5n v\xE0 t\xF4i \u0111ang th\u1EA5t nghi\u1EC7p \u0111\xF3i
    h\xE1 m\u1ED3m ra \u0111\xE2y b\xE0 cho t\xF4i ti\u1EC1n \u0111i."
  - "Mom:\nM\u1EB9 c\u0169ng l\u01B0\u1EDDng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    r\u1ED3i, ti\u1EC1n th\xEC m\u1EB9 k th\u1EC3 cho con nh\xE0 m\xECnh h\u1EBFt
    ti\u1EC1n r\u1ED3i c\xF2n \u0111\xE2u t\u1EEB ng\xE0y con b\u1ECF \u0111i nh\xE0
    m\xECnh ti\u1EC1n mua \u0111\u1ED3 \u0103n cho ch* h\u1EBFt r\u1ED3i"
  - "Mom:\nTh\u1EBF n\xEAn l\xFD do m\u1EB9 g\u1ECDi l\xE0 m\u1EB9 c\xF3 1 c\xF4ng
    vi\u1EC7c b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 d\xE0nh cho con. M\u1EB9 bi\u1EBFt con kh\xF4ng th\xEDch
    lao \u0111\u1ED9ng ch\xE2n tay v\xE0 l\u01B0\u1EDDi bi\u1EBFng, nh\u01B0ng c\xF4ng
    vi\u1EC7c n\xE0y c\xF3 th\u1EC3 gi\xFAp con thay \u0111\u1ED5i cu\u1ED9c \u0111\u1EDDi
    \u0111\u1EA5y."
  - "Mom:\nCon c\xF3 th\u1EC3 tr\u1EDF n\xEAn gi\xE0u c\xF3 v\xE0 n\u1ED5i ti\u1EBFng
    nh\u01B0 3 anh b\u1EA1n h\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EA1i h\u1ECDc c\u1EE7a con v\u1EADy
    v\xE0 theo ng\u01B0\u1EDDi gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n ng\u1ED3i 1
    ch\u1ED7 v\xE0 \u0111\u1EA3m b\u1EA3o kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\xEC h\u01B0 h\u1ECFng
    th\xF4i."
  - "Ch\u1EB3ng bi\u1EBFt n\u1EEFa,t\xF4i th\xEDch \u0103n kh\xF4ng ng\u1ED3i r\u1ED3i
    v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\u1EE5c v\u1EE5 nh\u01B0 ng\xE0y tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
    t\xF4i kh\xF4ng th\xEDch ph\u1EA3i l\xE0m g\xEC c\u1EA3."
  - "Mom:\n\u0110\u1EA5y l\xE0 quy\u1EC1n l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn c\u1EE7a con th\xF4i,
    n\u1EBFu thay \u0111\u1ED5i \xFD \u0111\u1ECBnh th\xEC cu\u1ED1i tu\u1EA7n n\xE0y
    h\xE3y \u0111i g\u1EB7p ng\u01B0\u1EDDi quen c\u1EE7a m\u1EB9. \xD4ng \u1EA5y
    r\u1EA5t uy t\xEDn c\xF3 ti\u1EBFng m\xE0 m\u1EB9 m\u1EDBi quen \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    g\u1EA7n \u0111\xE2y ch\xFA \u1EA5y m\u1EDBi chuy\u1EC3n \u0111\u1EBFn c\u1EA1nh
    nh\xE0 m\xECnh."
  lines_en:
  - What is this old bitch?
  - 'Mom:

    Hi son -  Its been too long since the last time I talked to you, how
    are you doing?'
  - Why do you care? I'm doing fine just fine besides having high blood fat, cirrhosis,
    diabetes, and a billion other underlying conditions related to weight. Also I
    have no job and need some money
  - 'Mom:

    Hmm I predicted that. About the money, we can''t lend you some because
    we spend it all on dog food and toys.'
  - 'Mom:

    But the reason why I called you is that I have a job position for
    you which is a security guard. I know you don''t want to do job that required
    manual labor and you too fat and lazy. But this opportunity can change your life
    son! '
  - 'Mom:

    Rich, fame and girls - all you want from life just like the 3 dudes
    you hung out with since college. And I heard all you need to do is sit in a chair
    and make sure that nothing goes wrong. '
  - 'I don''t know about that bitch, I only loving eating without working and being
    served. '
  - 'Mom:

    That''s your choice, if you change your mind, go meet one of my friend
    in this weekend. He is very trustworthy and famous in his field who just moved
    in our neighbourhood '
